          "short": "$8$",
          "worked": "The radius bisecting the chord is perpendicular to it. The radius is $6+4=10$.\n$$\\begin{align*}x^2+6^2&=10^2\\\\x^2&=64\\\\x&=8\\end{align*}$$",
