          "short": "$3$",
          "worked": "The radius is $x+2$. The radius bisecting the chord is perpendicular to it.\n$$\\begin{align*}x^2+4^2&=(x+2)^2\\\\x^2+16&=x^2+4x+4\\\\4x&=12\\\\x&=3\\end{align*}$$",
