          "worked": "The radius is $x+5$. The radius bisecting the chord is perpendicular to it.\n$$\\begin{align*}(x+5)^2&=5^2+6^2\\\\(x+5)^2&=61\\\\x+5&=\\sqrt{61}\\\\x&=\\sqrt{61}-5\\end{align*}$$",
